{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$g$", "MATH_0007": "$F$", "MATH_0008": "$G$", "MATH_0009": "$S$", "MATH_0010": "$F$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$G$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0014": "$1$", "MATH_0015": "$f' : \\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0016": "$f' : F \\to G$", "MATH_0017": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-representable-by-algebraic-spaces-on-space}\n\\vcenter{\n\\xymatrix{\nF \\ar[d]_{f'} &\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X}\n\\ar@{~>}[l] \\ar[d] \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^f \\\\\nG &\n\\mathcal{Z} \\ar@{~>}[l] \\ar[r]^-g &\n\\mathcal{Y}\n}\n}\n\\end{equation}", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-by-space-representable-by-space}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{equation-morphisms-spaces}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:af31369ba4f4254dac60481c445ad386b893851e11c6e29dee19f6f5578270c7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9efad3a3c29cdcb83ed3e1f60b0b2fa7306e388e3df635abfbb37774767acb18", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004>, <MATH_0005>, <MATH_0006> be as in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0007> and <MATH_0008> be algebraic spaces over <MATH_0009> such that\n<MATH_0010> represents <MATH_0011>\nand <MATH_0012> represents <MATH_0013>. The <MATH_0014>-morphism\n<MATH_0015>\ncorresponds to a morphism <MATH_0016> of algebraic spaces\nby (<REF_0002>).\nThus we have the following diagram\n<MATH_0017>\nwhere the squiggly arrows represent the construction which associates\nto a stack fibred in setoids its associated sheaf of isomorphism classes\nof objects.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bd7fbaaa8311d54596a281523f70754c84b7ced34150fd28fc3c71bb5e15d36b", "unit_id": "tag:04SX:prose-0004"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}, \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$g : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0007": "$1$", "MATH_0008": "$$\ng \\circ f : \\mathcal{X} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{Z}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$1$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-representable-by-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:314584c2008876c2ff7d0dedcdfb70fee1c4d58656b489494ba85ff198d54382", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1e9a4af57245a9472e026920520cd398e3e9b23bfff17070773597eb7d6847d8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nIf <MATH_0005>, <MATH_0006>\nare <MATH_0007>-morphisms representable by algebraic spaces, then\n<MATH_0008>\nis a <MATH_0009>-morphism representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3149dd2f13a4b8152e4bdfbdba0c925b173c8103f25d988139faf7eb328aeb3c", "unit_id": "tag:0301:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-by-space-representable-by-space}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d9a9ce71d01cef0829df2b87e46df6a4f6ef8b034d828a12da1229e141728961", "source_text": "This follows from\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nDetails omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:db539d613825cd9a2f0da1598b3967a748c1e6bbf06b897147a543d08dc33f85", "unit_id": "tag:0301:proof"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}_i, \\mathcal{Y}_i$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0006": "$f_i : \\mathcal{X}_i \\to \\mathcal{Y}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$$\nf_1 \\times f_2 :\n\\mathcal{X}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{Y}_2\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$1$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-product-representable-by-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0b9e417804af539c64416f4df9fde27287ca42c7edd1f0545b96a1e9e010bb9b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fda726dfe88728bd840bb4655366f1111955e58c6e90261fc32ccf5124683b96", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be categories fibred in groupoids over\n<MATH_0004>, <MATH_0005>.\nLet <MATH_0006>, <MATH_0007>\nbe <MATH_0008>-morphisms representable by algebraic spaces.\nThen\n<MATH_0009>\nis a <MATH_0010>-morphism representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:443985964d0714cecb985cd5a588c6dd8b83836b402ad0eff2cc824b0057626f", "unit_id": "tag:0303:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f_1 \\times f_2$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2 \\to\n\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2 \\to\n\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{Y}_2$", "MATH_0003": "$f_1$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2 \\to \\mathcal{Y}_1$", "MATH_0005": "$f_2$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{Y}_2 \\to \\mathcal{Y}_2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-composition-representable-by-spaces}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-representable-by-spaces}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3e539211ac6ee5a1c0ed4b7954dd4531cf7de6dd1e5800e839c340935a510b01", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1cdb767f4e2bd5f7801191ee51cb0de9aea7bf1337c2e2058eeb104fc3c1c7f9", "source_text": "Write <MATH_0001> as the composition\n<MATH_0002>.\nThe first arrow is the base change of <MATH_0003> by the map\n<MATH_0004>, and the second arrow\nis the base change of <MATH_0005> by the map\n<MATH_0006>.\nHence this lemma is a formal\nconsequence of Lemmas <REF_0001>\nand <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f6112264a0c2b59b41117ada6031bb289bbda87839d6b616d010007562767272", "unit_id": "tag:0303:proof"}
